# Trivy suppressions -- validated 2026-09-29.
#
# All entries come from parquet-jackson, which ships its own copy of
# jackson-databind relocated under shaded.parquet.*. Being a renamed package it
# is not a Maven coordinate, so no pin, BOM or exclusion can reach it, and
# Parquet is not removable (it is our primary file format). Our own resolved
# jackson-databind is 2.22.2 and is patched.
#
# Upgrading Iceberg, the parent that brings Parquet, does not help yet: 1.10.2
# brings Parquet 1.16.0 (shades jackson 2.19.2) and the latest 1.11.0 brings
# 1.17.1 (shades 2.21.3), while the fixes require >= 2.21.4 (CVE-2026-54512,
# CVE-2026-54513) and >= 2.21.6 (CVE-2026-68497).
#
# Apache Iceberg suppresses CVE-2026-54512 and CVE-2026-54513 for the same
# reason, see
# https://github.com/apache/iceberg/blob/main/.github/trivyignore/kafka-connect-runtime.trivyignore
#
# Clears when Iceberg moves to Parquet >= 1.18.1, which shades jackson 2.22.2.
CVE-2026-54512
CVE-2026-54513
CVE-2026-68497
